## RAG Based Problem Statement

## Title
Railway Passenger Information Assistant

## Problem Statement:
Railway passengers often face difficulties in finding accurate and reliable information related to ticket reservations, cancellation policies, refund procedures, luggage rules, Tatkal booking, boarding station changes, and other railway services. 
This information is usually distributed across lengthy documents, manuals, and official websites, making it difficult and time-consuming for passengers to access the required details quickly.
As a result, passengers may depend on unofficial sources and receive incorrect or outdated information. To address this challenge, a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)-based Railway Passenger Information Assistant is proposed.
The system retrieves relevant information from official railway documents and generates accurate, context-aware responses to user queries in natural language, enabling passengers to obtain trustworthy railway information efficiently and conveniently.
